# LaserBridgeOS is a headless appliance. Management starts through WebUI and
# SSH; local root login is locked, so virtual-console gettys add no recovery
# path and are intentionally not spawned.
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc -q sysinit
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc -q boot
::wait:/sbin/openrc -q default

::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/sbin/openrc -q shutdown
